{
  "schema_version": 1,
  "batch": 1217,
  "batch_count": 1645,
  "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
  "source_commit": "d2656fb43e00556ee3186c852692cfa26a722dbc",
  "source_language": "zh-CN",
  "entries": [
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:75e61d6c1cbee95f9f559052",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "新年快乐～\r\n要不要一起玩歌牌呢？\r\n是时候让你见识一下有着歌牌段位的我的力量了。",
      "source_fingerprint": "196874094a3e81f12d53188e558f2216acee26b4b24b9f1eba0309d8f335c392",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1011",
        "10003"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d744e3612de14a81a738be63",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "这是我喜欢的日式点心，\r\n还请您收下。\r\n除了巧克力以外的情人节礼物不也别有一番滋味吗？",
      "source_fingerprint": "6adbb94c08df7b9a194545828da96460c72eb1e7dcf3c405aaf376cf38dd6e98",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1011",
        "10004"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d19a848b83a0bd31ba2dbc39",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "训练员，要不要来点\r\n和甜味很搭的抹茶呢？\r\n就让我饱含真情地给您泡上一杯吧。",
      "source_fingerprint": "143a054547e18b732c9fa270bc8ffe330fa6d9871920a6ccab6721b21bba4d4b",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1011",
        "10005"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f2286cf9052fc033245d38a2",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "据说七夕还有在梶叶上\r\n写和歌献给星星的习俗。\r\n要一起，写上一首吗？",
      "source_fingerprint": "861de079fb3f4b5a7aa6f8a25faa0313aaaa782b7c1dd61838762eda7d898db1",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1011",
        "10006"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:bb3919cfed5ef721dfbcf70a",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "和式豆粉果子、馒头、金锷烧……\r\n南瓜其实能变成\r\n各式各样的点心哦♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "910711dfaf9d20064041a05a2cfead851612c2275971a8533e0b5a3ef74a15fc",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1011",
        "10007"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:645d7e61f97933ce067a2833",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "因为我的老家每年都会在这个时候挂上灯笼，\r\n所以一到圣诞季节，\r\n家里就会变成观光胜地呢♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "00630f82e59be1cadff53e306d195e7aab6c9a2621fb54d7f58b64de48bc5999",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1011",
        "10008"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e673bc23b84489112b23e9ed",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "火鸡肉做的龙田炸鸡、日式点心蛋糕和盆栽树\r\n都已经准备好了。让我们一起\r\n悠闲地度过圣诞夜吧？",
      "source_fingerprint": "d788ddad50443a6e650e8323b6f2f2cb712b237127fa7f2b4e52b6caad92891d",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1011",
        "10009"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:17d3f66a1175d996bc1afdb6",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我一直相信我们能赢哦♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "3f454851b84a3e745337b8dd6ed09e7dc1b8a487a8b82ee12285df674d851764",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1011",
        "1001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:418b1ad2801b5e08852a574b",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "多亏了训练员您，\r\n今年我也切实地感觉到自己在稳步前进。\r\n明年也要，更进一步……！",
      "source_fingerprint": "583e1fc8017582f7582e303ffb43cc487af39ab5df10221eb4614ddf86b6018c",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1011",
        "10010"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d33035c4f3636ea4c42a6bbe",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "生日快乐♪\r\n为了不输给每天努力的训练员，\r\n我也会继续努力的。",
      "source_fingerprint": "89891c805f5bd31e35292778f0a5d3c5ff81bbaf36ceaa531a29e65adaea17ca",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1011",
        "10011"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:bff9c5dc64b115760c2b0c23",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "恭喜您又添一岁。\r\n春夏秋冬、四季更替……\r\n来年也，想要为您庆生呢。",
      "source_fingerprint": "f2d41bdf8af619c2af0fd28d19781ebc9d1de666fa2747e33ea16f36528e102b",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1011",
        "10012"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:3efe6bad7ce5c42622f0eb17",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "大家都来庆祝我的生日……\r\n真是感慨万千。\r\n不以礼还礼，可不行呢。",
      "source_fingerprint": "3e85408aca26b8a2c54015e2d0201389dae979de5c3249df49db0992daf9e976",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1011",
        "10013"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:af663d3727769b4d8add6916",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "虽然自以为擅长日语了，\r\n但在这种时候却找不到好的表达方式……\r\n呃。能收到你的祝福……我很高兴。",
      "source_fingerprint": "9938f6dd1d410180cdf40107ae988c805ec98e91fdfbf01477b5191596521c34",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1011",
        "10014"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d7d789385fcc49918e937dd3",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "好像有通知哦。\r\n一边喝茶一边一起确认吧。",
      "source_fingerprint": "a8fee70974a26f6d35b85add729de2c84ac3f519f3f35c050b029308b442b3f3",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1011",
        "10015"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:62a55a1257180702038a0362",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "有礼物送到了呢。\r\n“打开了就会被吓一跳的玉匣”…\r\n说不定这个是吧？",
      "source_fingerprint": "a92eb61f71facfcd7004375f762615ee4f4b7a3954cc30f8e096c9dd24887253",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1011",
        "10016"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:19d9fafb6042bf3a258d65d3",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "任务完成，辛苦了。\r\n以此为目标而不懈努力……确实是很重要的呢对吧。",
      "source_fingerprint": "492e27a1cc30c9f4fd3beaa5778edb3c2f61811f8ee18dcd6bebe556b0fa7386",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1011",
        "10017"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:3203ec550ce7b752a87e8804",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "活动马上就要开始了呢。\r\n您准备好了吗？",
      "source_fingerprint": "4a20e8a9e9496acd605ebf88ea00703d82e3388c3be22a1572f41f2fb0ae1a59",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1011",
        "10018"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b1603f16a56ca10ad0e7720a",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "活动开始了呢。悠闲地\r\n按照自己的步调前进……但心中\r\n依旧期望着胜利……一起加油吧♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "e7660c8705dfe5f44ab7f46bafc42e4e3b677be76bc1e80483b4fefc8a0d8c02",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1011",
        "10019"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c007ce215bfe80cb395e2684",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "不甘心，下次一定会……",
      "source_fingerprint": "0fdbac7e6b93d44e559f251b5517aa6098b3911ee6f7c77736bb2af104c4d9d5",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1011",
        "1002"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:4d22e9712bab5ab330d85d76",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "诶呀，赛马娘名鉴的等级\r\n好像提升了呢。",
      "source_fingerprint": "0002a74d88a00e39391264853e3dc4156d8a958ec775299ae2ff1f306c809353",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1011",
        "10021"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:84f3d4fedf0a414f1eda2191",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "任何时候都莫忘对比赛的热情。\r\n就算是在日常生活之中，\r\n蹄铁扣也会让我回想起这件事。",
      "source_fingerprint": "3098c5863bd5b4d26a8be0c08941e53775a0ae270bd1aa4070cf69f63c7a6d77",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1011",
        "10025"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:2e4e9f67f5e6755f3f6d0990",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "洗衣精的香味和平常不同……啊，\r\n其实是小鹰把辣酱溅到我身上，\r\n所以替我洗衣服赔罪。",
      "source_fingerprint": "313a283482e40fe6f1d1190a061ef80915d39698a70cbc8201823f14196a73c6",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1011",
        "10026"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f5071309d96d2af1609b5633",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "到神社、寺庙朝圣时，我有留意\r\n要让服装配合庄严肃穆的氛围。\r\n因为我并不想破坏气氛。",
      "source_fingerprint": "d71a0cce6452b19825544c23f7ac679e919b24562ad843a51d253e5ffe75a84f",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1011",
        "10027"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:2c0fa008c330d964b674cf46",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "啊啦啦，是平局吗。",
      "source_fingerprint": "347cca8e4aef04ce9383bfa8c7558ef007da6c30c6728fe5f763cef80f7451e5",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1011",
        "1003"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e6cb5b31dcb28c353a104d5b",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "是我们的胜利！",
      "source_fingerprint": "d9ace708ce11f8b377e32264a7390dae84cfd64bd7e0de4c8f418bc3cab67755",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1011",
        "1004"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ada7bb3cd955286f3581fb95",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "不甘心，下次一定会……",
      "source_fingerprint": "0fdbac7e6b93d44e559f251b5517aa6098b3911ee6f7c77736bb2af104c4d9d5",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1011",
        "1005"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:54920caa3902c3caeaaf1858",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "啊啦啦，是平局吗。",
      "source_fingerprint": "347cca8e4aef04ce9383bfa8c7558ef007da6c30c6728fe5f763cef80f7451e5",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1011",
        "1006"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:05a6f9dfc850957789b1a13e",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "最高分刷新了呢♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "ea6e314751c96501c80ca9d73ec8ca8af95ec92121b9e45ee782ac2472d7a7e5",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1011",
        "1007"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:6025daed8e97f0247fa03e07",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "如果是我们的话，能赢……！",
      "source_fingerprint": "6cb203e20f5417f569f9c1eb2bab66769a38e68ad612fedba5b0c835d4905df5",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1011",
        "1008"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:6133e588dfab15e20025f905",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "Yes♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "cd935a7ec8d5a93398a955217cd92ff49bf9aa0637e4aa0e516402c788a86268",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1011",
        "1027"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:9d589abf1c3a0fc7618d8bc6",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "要起舞了……！",
      "source_fingerprint": "b11eac524acc4d371b888c39bcd9613fb0e714db91a4e5c6083169b98ede2ad4",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1011",
        "1029"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:55caf84b6b4bd1dd7493f288",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "一起去入闸吧？",
      "source_fingerprint": "8adc3d98ce842bf2ec9f56290e95094b629644e83b9e05b06298910d16da0445",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1011",
        "1030"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:64c0e654815b301ee129329e",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "Cygames♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "a0ace34bfc15d5f0c7b931c44c7863b9695e6654f6bfeeb81e86032c00d60b75",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1011",
        "11"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:65fbeaa1b812ee2ac80ec43f",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "要进行怎样的训练项目呢？",
      "source_fingerprint": "5fca5e4bf6ee1f8e02eeb165bc0f629df46d96d1e4d8bb579d7aac37d3dd5665",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1011",
        "110000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:747bfaf247dfd4befcc183d0",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "尽是些饶有趣味的故事呢♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "985cd6ce09d4807176d7b7da0de0551e5577b3dc04e3ed8515299217e5a0da37",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1011",
        "110001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:dd78805467189e2de241fda2",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "要去报名参加比赛吗？",
      "source_fingerprint": "343b78e6fdc6dfe2906052ca98f00b3915b5d1b9e90b69b62f080654c80ff299",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1011",
        "110002"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:896c543bd7ff56b960f6379c",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "赛马娘 Pretty Derby♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "d1b5e05986797dbaa89fd60725a452035804f1f1f6acac29a4dfa3a21407b820",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1011",
        "12"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:0cb4330da5fc9a28dcedd4c5",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "这股温暖的感觉是……",
      "source_fingerprint": "0afe315bfd5d7e69f82c558276e1878f9cb49aaba9b3e1128dccc1d5133ff20f",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1011",
        "120000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:94ede800bf8ec83cdf47821f",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "似乎是\r\n今天的登录奖励呢。",
      "source_fingerprint": "c487433d8995dd852804d4f190f117b92e242d2a2eb7762c7b5f6c44a4ec794d",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1011",
        "13"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:04be3b9931dd0174e43f028f",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "冷静地开始吧～♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "ba8fff8a50da6fb432002a6558b921c998ed2e1699e5bf5c4d9c0bc93a4b9371",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1011",
        "140000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:1a83b7fad62c4ad1edcb68bb",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "做到啦♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "c01f3cd81581ae874bef45b8c9755e40a4e7216e80c1322fa44c6072bd18ef60",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1011",
        "140001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:de54af370ade4e147e20ce24",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "啊啊……！",
      "source_fingerprint": "ca2bfeb016b31251d02d124e40bbc72c49d33cc628f270bda341fc51699d29a1",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1011",
        "140002"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e2af35def5f2539410ce7a46",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "哼哼，夹到了很多呢♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "558ca229a728b6df04b685e502e2d04dfd20654f8ceec5e2fda72f6b877aaecd",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1011",
        "140003"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b5935bef76ccffea4fcb1666",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "干得漂亮！",
      "source_fingerprint": "8e9deba3fd1d32bb7e6ecc9fdd820f0ff3b0fc3c7d828d7babf2a4765856b130",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1011",
        "140004"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:2da43177ac6c0e70a042e7a8",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "嗯——，比想象中的还要难呢。",
      "source_fingerprint": "6f0105d4398815aea7680150d74f6ac639e13bc28bebfb343b2a254014b9259b",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
